    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the money though. it's the look on people's faces. the pity. the way they'll look at me like i'm some kind of cautionary tale. i've spent my whole life building something respectable, and now i have to just sit here and watch myself becoming a joke. there's no dignity in the crash, just this slow, pathetic crawl to the bottom where everyone can see how much i failed.",
